  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1464716/description_925329ea-9187-440a-9a19-d254f1bbaf2a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>ShrapnelExplosions V2.0：致命环境更新 - 现已发布！</h1>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ImfovWWC2Ag\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>现在，当爆炸发生时，每个方块都会碎裂成具有自身物理属性的碎片。它们会造成伤害，穿透薄障碍物，并从金属物体上反弹。每次碰撞后，碎片会消耗其动能，从而降低速度并改变轨迹。</p>\n<p>爆炸会产生两个不同层次的破坏效果，使每次爆炸都感觉混乱且逼真：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>初级破片（初始爆炸）：</strong>这些是从爆炸本身直接生成的高速碎片。它们代表了爆炸的外壳和核心能量，瞬间飞出，覆盖周围区域。</li>\n<li><strong>次级残骸（环境因素）：</strong>这些投射物是由爆炸实际摧毁的方块生成的。如果爆炸撕开了一座房子，房子本身就变成了破片。石墙会产生沉重致命的碎块，而玻璃窗则会碎裂成一团快速、尖锐的碎片云。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><em><strong>需要：</strong></em>&nbsp;<em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></em></h4>\n<h4><em><strong>为了获得最佳性能：</strong></em> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/asyncparticles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AsyncParticles</a>，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flerovium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flerovium</a></h4>\n<h1>次级残骸演示</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1464716/description_c882b3dc-b7a4-49fd-bf37-e4310a30f667.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1464716/description_0a671603-5ae0-4851-bc51-c82b37427a92.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1464716/description_f8540a26-59ce-4ab2-959d-69b74a9dc8e6.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1464716/description_ddacaec4-d325-4b6a-abee-a5ebcd4aa320.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>初级破片演示</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_82feaca6-91a8-4d56-b37c-23e36ee0cee0.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d2f7a450-bb62-45f2-9024-d74eeb886676.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f59c2c83-f488-4d67-b110-c8b8e5874f99.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>碎片可以穿透木门、栅栏、树叶和玻璃等薄障碍物；</li>\n<li>碎片穿过障碍物时会失去速度，并且可能改变其轨迹；</li>\n<li>破片可以从铁块、铁门、金块、铜块以及声音类型名称中包含“金属”或“铜”的其他物体上反弹；</li>\n<li>不同类型的物体对碎片的减速效果各不相同；</li>\n<li>本模组提供配置菜单。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explosion-overhaul-a-new-level-of-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Explosion Overhaul</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superb-warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] Superb Warfare</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>您也可以尝试</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realistic-bullet-impact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1464716/description_630b02fe-d32d-4b2f-8322-54fa11792520.png\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realistic-bullet-impact\" width=\"203\" height=\"203\"></a></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>",
